================================================================================
Edge invariant (constitutional — ADR-2605241900)
================================================================================

This crate is part of the baien edge inference path. The edge target is
WASM-32 + iPhone 12+ + Android 4 GB. This crate MUST NOT increase
peak runtime memory beyond:

  - ≤ 2.0 GB at 4 k context
  - ≤ 2.5 GB at 16 k context

Frontier-beating throughput is EXPLICITLY NOT A GOAL. Optimisations
that improve throughput at the cost of breaking the memory envelope
are out of scope per ADR-2605241900 §invariants.
